g 1","default":"Customer stories"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"What our clients say"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Rated 5.0 on Google across 15 reviews."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"“Great IT support company. The WhizzIT team are professional, responsive and easy to work with. Any issues are dealt with quickly and they are never slow to pick up the phone.”"},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Caption 1","default":"TS"},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Tommy Sabine"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Caption 2","default":"Director, Codeshield"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"“Working with Billy and the WhizzIT team has been a revelation. Amazing support in set up, outstanding customer service and a pleasure at every interaction. Great to have our IT support in such safe hands.”"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Caption 3","default":"MB"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 2","default":"Mark Bremner"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Caption 4","default":"CEO, MBKB Group"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"“They provide IT services for my 24 bed hotel, restaurant and newly refurbished sports bar and grill. Very responsive, knowledgeable and very reasonably priced. Special mention to Billy who never fails to pick up the phone.”"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"Caption 5","default":"JP"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"Bold text 3","default":"John Pringle"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Caption 6","default":"CEO, The Portland Hotel Group"}]}